        1119
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The Transportation Administration (hereinafter referred to as \"the Administration\") and the Transportation Council have heretofore been established by Executive Order No. 4 of January 17, 1966, as a first step in the coordination of transportation planning, development and operation; and",
